# Writing Articles
The same format, laid out as a page
9 Oct 2026
Tags: present, article
Summary: A .article file uses the present format for a long page instead of slides.

Ada Example
ada@example.com

## Articles

A file ending in `.article` is shown as one page,
like a blog post, instead of as slides.
Everything that works in a `.slide` file works here too,
and sections are numbered in a table of contents.

## Code

.play code/fib/main.go

The source can be shown in pieces, with prose between them:

.code code/pipeline/main.go /^func worker/,/^}/

| Format  | File       | Layout                |
|---------|------------|-----------------------|
| slides  | `.slide`   | one section per slide |
| article | `.article` | one long page         |

### A subsection

Subsections start with `###` and nest inside a section.

